## Anti-patterns

| ❌ Don’t | ✅ Do |
|---------|--------|
| Bare `IPI-249` in user text | Full **IPI-249 · DESIGN-058 — …** |
| Trust this rule’s dates/examples | Re-read live Linear |
| Put every open ticket in a beta cycle | Only capacity-backed, unblocked work |
| Milestone only to inflate % | Milestone outcome-bearing delivery work |
| Mark Done because a sibling PR merged | Evidence for **this** issue’s ACs |
| Silently reopen Done | Propose + approve (unless task authorizes) |
| Delete Done→open edges for “cleanliness” | Keep valid historical prerequisites |
| Edit `progress.md` in a Linear-only pass | Linear doc / issues only unless asked |
| Start HOLD DNS work in beta cleanup | Keep HOLD field combination intact |
| Assume MCP tool names without discovery | Discover, then call |

## Live-state file reference

After material Linear changes (or on a scheduled refresh), update:

`tasks/linear/live-workspace-state.md`

with verified-at timestamp, current milestones/dates, active cycle, HOLD gates, and illustrative (non-authoritative) dependency notes. That file never overrides live Linear.
